      "locked": "/Users/owner/Documents/coding/add-utc-demo",
      "nested": false,
      "why": "the same root is PROJECT_LOCKED, not nested"
    }
  ],
  "group_kill_at_takeover": [
    "snapshot ps -A -o pid=,ppid=,pgid=,lstart=,comm=",
    "the group is still the recorded one if its leader (pid = pgid) is alive with the recorded start time, or if no process has pid = pgid any more; not if a process with that pid has another start time, and then nothing is signalled by group",
    "targets: every process in the group, plus every descendant by ppid of the leader or a member, each started at or after the recorded start time",
    "SIGTERM the group and each other target, wait 2 s, SIGKILL the same set",
    "confirm for up to 3 s that no target with a matching start time is alive; otherwise the takeover stays leftover and names them",
    "this is not the Codex rule: Codex's commands share the app-server's group across projects, so Codex kills never use a group"
  ]
}
